// The barkeep's greeting is a node group: every node titled Greeting is one
// candidate, and its `when:` header says when it fits. Each conversation runs
// the fitting candidate seen least, then the most specific one.

title: Greeting
when: once
---
Barkeep: Welcome to the Crooked Lantern, traveller! #line:welcome
===

title: Greeting
when: $coins < 3
---
Barkeep: Light purse tonight? The fire's free, at least. #line:greet_broke
===

title: Greeting
when: always
---
Barkeep: Back again? Pull up a stool. #line:greet_back
===
